Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 20:01:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] models/nmt.py: fix NameError on Nmt.verify() fallback path

Nmt.verify() calls check_output() and time.time()/time.sleep() when the
bhashini_models health check fails, but the module never imports
subprocess.check_output or the time module. Every call path through
verify() that actually needs to restart bhashini_models.service (i.e.
exactly the case verify() exists to handle) raises NameError instead of
restarting the service.

Add the same two imports models/asr.py already has for the identical
verify()/update() pattern.
---
 python/pocketinfer/models/nmt.py | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/python/pocketinfer/models/nmt.py b/python/pocketinfer/models/nmt.py
index 85b7263..776f1e8 100644
--- a/python/pocketinfer/models/nmt.py
+++ b/python/pocketinfer/models/nmt.py
@@ -1,4 +1,6 @@
 import requests
+import time
+from subprocess import check_output
 
 
 class Nmt:
